1
00:00:00,083 --> 00:00:01,083
Hey, stop!

2
00:00:02,836 --> 00:00:04,796
Why do you bring up
such things?

3
00:00:04,922 --> 00:00:06,298
It shouldn't be aired

4
00:00:06,423 --> 00:00:08,133
Why? This is
a reality show

5
00:00:08,258 --> 00:00:09,618
You should show
everything as it is

6
00:00:09,676 --> 00:00:12,638
So everyone he liked
was a bad one?

7
00:00:12,763 --> 00:00:14,473
Has he never
dated anyone properly?

8
00:00:14,598 --> 00:00:15,724
No, it's not true

9
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:16,850
Don't believe him

10
00:00:16,975 --> 00:00:18,310
He's just kidding

11
00:00:18,435 --> 00:00:19,561
Ah!

12
00:00:19,686 --> 00:00:21,021
He once fell
for a nice one

13
00:00:23,065 --> 00:00:24,441
-It was me
-Hey!

14
00:00:24,566 --> 00:00:25,817
Gosh, you startled me

15
00:00:25,943 --> 00:00:28,278
You kept following me
when we were young

16
00:00:28,403 --> 00:00:29,863
That's ancient history

17
00:00:29,988 --> 00:00:32,115
And you know, I didn't
have a crush on you

18
00:00:32,241 --> 00:00:33,408
Huh?

19
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:35,369
You were so cute
back then

20
00:00:35,494 --> 00:00:36,245
Come on

21
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:37,746
Wow, you guys
are making me jealous

22
00:00:37,871 --> 00:00:40,707
I wish I also had
a friend like you

23
00:00:44,378 --> 00:00:45,671
By the way…

24
00:00:45,796 --> 00:00:46,796
have we met before?

25
00:00:50,759 --> 00:00:51,759
Sure, I know you

26
00:00:52,803 --> 00:00:54,012
because you're
a superstar

27
00:00:57,224 --> 00:00:58,892
Let's take five

28
00:01:02,729 --> 00:01:03,729
What are you thinking?

29
00:01:06,733 --> 00:01:07,733
I just…

30
00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:11,405
I don't know
what to do now

31
00:01:11,530 --> 00:01:13,782
Just take it easy

32
00:01:13,907 --> 00:01:14,908
You can even
fall asleep

33
00:01:16,994 --> 00:01:18,620
But…

34
00:01:18,745 --> 00:01:20,872
What do you think
about today's shooting?

35
00:01:20,998 --> 00:01:22,958
You didn't seem
to like me

36
00:01:24,334 --> 00:01:26,044
You only chatted
with Soobin

37
00:01:26,169 --> 00:01:27,729
You didn't even make
eye contact with me

38
00:01:29,464 --> 00:01:30,841
Oh, did I get caught?

39
00:01:30,966 --> 00:01:31,966
What?

40
00:01:37,014 --> 00:01:38,974
But you also

41
00:01:39,099 --> 00:01:40,934
knew Soobin

42
00:01:42,936 --> 00:01:44,521
because you guys
are neighbors

43
00:01:47,566 --> 00:01:48,566
Well…

44
00:01:49,693 --> 00:01:50,693
I didn't know that

45
00:01:53,405 --> 00:01:54,725
but I've seen him
way before that…
